{"ref":"BDB, חֵרֵשׁ","hw":"חֵרֵשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵרֵשׁ</span></big>  <strong>adj. deaf</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">חֵרֵשׁ</span> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">חִרֵּשׁ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:11\" href=\"/Exodus.4.11\">Ex 4:11</a> + 4 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵרְשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.18\">Is 29:18</a> + 3 times;—<em>deaf</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:11\" href=\"/Exodus.4.11\">Ex 4:11</a> (J; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִלֵּם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:14\" href=\"/Psalms.38.14\">ψ 38:14</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); also <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.14\">Lv 19:14</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.18\">Is 29:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.5\">35:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.18\">42:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.19\">19</a> + v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.19\">19</a> b (for last <span dir=\"rtl\">עִוֵּר</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.8\">43:8</a>; Gr<sup>JQ 1891, Oct. p. 2</sup> v. Che<sup>Comm., JQ Jan. 1892, 332</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.8\">43:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫תֶן ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:5\" href=\"/Psalms.58.5\">ψ 58:5</a> <em>a deaf adder</em>.","next":"BDB, חֶ֫רֶשׁ","prev":"BDB, חָרֵשׁ"}